# Upstream reference source snapshots are intentionally tracked for auditable local design review. The working Git
# metadata/checkouts remain ignored; the product build never includes anything below references/.
# 上游参考源码快照按要求纳入版本控制以便审计；工作 Git metadata/checkout 仍忽略，产品 build 永不包含 references/。
references/.checkouts/
references/.staging/
references/*/.git/

# Local test evidence may contain proprietary paths or CAD content.
test-evidence/
live-evidence/

图纸/

# SOLIDWORKS may emit a machine-local diagnostic log when launched from the repository.
# SOLIDWORKS 从仓库工作目录启动时可能生成机器本地诊断日志；它不属于产品源码或测试证据。
console.log

